OmaWhatsApp dependency patch 2 of 3: exact upstream backport, unmodified.

This is upstream openclaw/wacli commit
7c1b3bfbeb26b929ca60e3cbae1511ad9c58a02d, "fix(sync): refuse delegated
operations still queued at the caller's deadline" (#456, released in wacli
v0.20.0), limited to cmd/wacli. Its only parent is the pinned base
b87e6178b7b1e571ce2821ab516039cfa0c6ecf6. Upstream author: Tsavo Knott;
co-authors: Peter Steinberger and Claude. MIT licence, as upstream.

Everything from the first diff line onward is byte-for-byte the output of
  git diff b87e6178 7c1b3bfb -- cmd/wacli
in an upstream clone with git's default diff settings (for example with
GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1). git apply ignores this
header. Upstream's CHANGELOG.md and docs/sync.md hunks are not included.

